<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="eyebrow light">UAV ENGINEERING · SOLAR · AGRICULTURE</div>
    <h1>Cleaning solar panels,<br><span>from a different angle.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Falcon builds practical drone platforms for solar cleaning, agriculture and specialist commercial operations — with the aircraft designed around the job it has to do.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/drones">Explore the fleet <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link light-link" href="/contact#quote">Talk to our team <span>→</span></a></div>
    <div class="hero-proof"><div><strong>06</strong><span>UAV platforms</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>engineering approach</span></div><div><strong>PK</strong><span>based in Pakistan</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-label">FALCON / 2026</div>
</section>

<section class="section intro-section">
  <div class="container intro-grid">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">01 / WHAT WE BUILD</div><h2>Machines for work,<br><span>not just for show.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="intro-copy"><p>Falcon focuses on application-led UAV design. Our platforms are developed around the payload, surface, environment and operating workflow — so the drone is part of the solution, not the whole story.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">More about Falcon <span>→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section fleet-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / THE FLEET</div><h2>Featured platforms</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/drones">View all drones <span>→</span></a></div>
    <div class="fleet-grid"><% drones.slice(0,4).forEach((d, i)=>{ %><a class="fleet-card <%= i === 0 ? 'fleet-card-featured' : '' %>" href="/drones/<%= d.slug %>"><div class="fleet-image"><img src="<%= d.image %>" alt="<%= d.name %> drone platform" loading="lazy"><span class="card-number">0<%= i+1 %></span></div><div class="fleet-body"><div><span class="category"><%= d.category %></span><h3><%= d.name %></h3></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></div></a><% }) %></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark mission-section">
  <div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow light">03 / APPLICATIONS</div><h2>One platform. Different missions.</h2></div><p class="heading-note">Configure the aircraft around the operation — from solar maintenance to field work and specialist inspection.</p></div>
    <div class="mission-grid"><a href="/solutions#solar"><span>01</span><div><h3>Solar cleaning</h3><p>Brush-based cleaning concepts for rooftop and commercial solar installations.</p></div><b>↗</b></a><a href="/solutions#agriculture"><span>02</span><div><h3>Agriculture</h3><p>Precision spraying platforms developed around efficient field operations.</p></div><b>↗</b></a><a href="/solutions#inspection"><span>03</span><div><h3>Inspection &amp; mapping</h3><p>UAV configurations for assets, terrain and hard-to-reach environments.</p></div><b>↗</b></a><a href="/solutions#custom"><span>04</span><div><h3>Custom UAV</h3><p>Payload, battery and mission requirements turned into a practical aircraft.</p></div><b>↗</b></a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section process-section">
  <div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">04 / OUR APPROACH</div><h2>Start with the problem.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="process-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>We define the surface, payload, coverage and operating conditions.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Configure</h3><p>Airframe, cleaning system, battery and navigation are matched to the mission.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Develop</h3><p>Mechanical and UAV systems come together as one application-focused platform.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>Support</h3><p>Direct communication keeps configuration, service and future changes simple.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta-section"><div class="container cta-card"><div><div class="eyebrow">LET'S BUILD THE RIGHT PLATFORM</div><h2>Have a solar site,<br>payload or mission in mind?</h2></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact#quote">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
